{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["Ten women — that is, many, as in ״this ten times you have humiliated me״." "In one oven — because a single woman cannot fill the oven with bread." "And they shall bring back your bread by weight — because by weight they brought it to the oven and by weight they brought it back to feed it to the owners, and by weight and by ration: bread restricted and water pressed, as it is written: ״Son of man, I am breaking the staff of bread in Jerusalem, and they shall eat bread by weight and in anxiety, and water by measure״. So here too it is written: ״when I break for you the staff of bread״ — he bakes and eats by weight." "And you shall eat and not be satisfied — because he eats it by weight and by ration. And one may also say that that bread, even though one eats much of it, will not satisfy and sustain a person, because a curse will be found in it."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:49:29.892841163Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}